[h2]Support[/h2]
Portal and every map it makes are free. Nothing is locked, early-access or donor-only. If you'd like to support Portal's development, you can buy me a coffee: [url=https://buymeacoffee.com/derpasauruo]https://buymeacoffee.com/derpasauruo[/url]. Tips go to Portal (by Dean) only, not to KnoxMap, euclid80tr or The Indie Stone.
